### Changed

- Integrate the M9 Frontend Redesign branches into `main` for v1.9.0. ([#244](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/244))

### Added

- Add inline citation badges to sanitized Markdown answers through `AssistantMarkdown.Render(markdown, citations)`. ([#245](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/245))
- Add a primary ticket action based on the first actionable `SuggestedNextSteps` item. ([#237](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/237))
- Add a keyboard-operated `CommandPalette` accessible with Ctrl/Cmd+K across pages. ([#236](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/236))
- Apply ticket status changes optimistically on the board and detail view, with rollback on rejection. ([#235](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/235))
- Replace ticket status and assignee dialogs with inline `MudMenu` popovers. ([#234](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/234))
- Add inline citation badges with hover and focus previews to assistant answers. ([#233](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/233))
- Inject the active agent roster into the chat system prompt for each request. ([#221](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/221))
- Force one `check_grounding` call through `tool_choice` after retrieval when no check has run. ([#218](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/218))
- Centralize palette, spacing, radius, elevation, and semantic colors in `Theme/DesignTokens.cs`. ([#213](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/213))

### Fixed

- Wrap board card titles so the two-line `-webkit-line-clamp` applies. ([#240](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/240))
- Fix the assistant panel styling so its send button stays inside the panel. ([#239](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/239))
- Fix the ticket queue's `Category` header width and styling so it does not overlap `Due`. ([#238](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/238))
- Add system-prompt rules that require a successful tool result before claiming a write and avoid repeated confirmation of requested changes. ([#223](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/223))
- Render ticket summary timestamps in `Anthropic:UserTimeZone`. ([#222](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/222))
- Report technical `search_knowledge_base` failures with `IsError: true`. ([#220](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/220))
- Score grounding by semantic similarity with `SemanticGroundingEvaluator`, retaining `LexicalGroundingEvaluator` as a fallback. ([#219](https://github.com/goldbarth/ServiceDeskLite/pull/219))
